+# Governance
+This project for the S-level Physical Memory Protection (SPMP) specification is governed by the Privileged ISA committee.
+
+The group can be joined by RISC-V members at: https://lists.riscv.org/g/tech-spmp.
+
+Mailing list archives are available at: https://lists.riscv.org/g/tech-spmp/topics.
+
